{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q424412","formula":"C₂₂H₂₄FN₃O₂","hill":"C22H24FN3O2","elements":["H","C","N","O","F"],"composition":{"C":22.0,"F":1.0,"H":24.0,"N":3.0,"O":2.0},"names":{"en":"Benperidol","ru":"Бенперидол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Benperidol, sold under the trade name Anquil among others, is a typical antipsychotic primarily used to treat hypersexuality syndromes and can be used to treat schizophrenia. It is a highly potent butyrophenone derivative and is the most potent neuroleptic in the European market, with chlorpromazine equivalency as high as 75 to 100 (about 150 to 200% the potency per dose of haloperidol). It is sometimes prescribed to sex offenders as a condition of their parole, as an alternative to anti-androgen drugs such as cyproterone acetate.","ru":"Бенперидо́л — лекарственное средство, нейролептик. Является производным бутирофенона, по химическому строению аналогичен дроперидолу, от которого отличается наличием в структуре пиперидинового фрагмента вместо тетрагидропиридинового. По фармакологическому действию также сходен с галоперидолом, однако превосходит его по эффективности."},"fame":17,"pubchemCid":16363,"mass":381.4,"charge":0,"smiles":"C1CN(CCC1N2C3=CC=CC=C3NC2=O)CCCC(=O)C4=CC=C(C=C4)F","inchikey":"FEBOTPHFXYHVPL-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"3-[1-[4-(4-fluorophenyl)-4-oxobutyl]piperidin-4-yl]-1H-benzimidazol-2-one","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"16363","atoms":52,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":6.12,"y":-3.899,"z":0.032,"el":"F"},{"x":-1.793,"y":-1.754,"z":1.259,"el":"O"},{"x":5.072,"y":2.217,"z":-0.898,"el":"O"},{"x":0.161,"y":2.264,"z":0.543,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.255,"y":-0.212,"z":0.192,"el":"N"},{"x":-4.015,"y":-2.296,"z":0.657,"el":"N"},{"x":-2.413,"y":0.952,"z":0.081,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.182,"y":0.662,"z":-0.778,"el":"C"},